# Response headers for the STATIC ASSETS this project serves -- the page, its modules and its
# stylesheet. Pages reads this file natively: no build step, no dependency, and it cannot be
# forgotten at deploy time the way a header set in code can.
#
# It does NOT reach a response generated by a Function, "even if the request URL matches a rule
# defined in _headers" -- https://developers.cloudflare.com/pages/configuration/headers/. So
# /api/* carries none of this. That costs nothing today: those responses are JSON, no-store,
# with no CORS header, so nothing cross-origin can read them anyway.
#
# What it does cost is a trap, and it is the reason this paragraph exists. `_routes.json` is the
# single knob that decides the page itself is a static asset. Widen its `include` from /api/* to
# /* -- the shape Cloudflare's own docs example uses, and the obvious move for anyone making the
# Function answer for more paths -- and index.html becomes a Function response: the two headers
# below that stop this page being framed disappear, with no error, no failing request and no
# visible symptom. The page still renders. `test/authz.test.mjs` pins that include so the change
# fails a test instead of failing silently.
#
# The one that earns its place is `frame-ancestors 'none'`. This page can stop a charge,
# the owner is by definition signed in while looking at it, and a framed page plus one
# baited click is a hardware action. X-Frame-Options repeats it for anything that predates
# the CSP directive.
#
# `form-action 'none'`: nothing here posts a form, and the page carries a credential field
# in one state -- so the value of a stray or injected <form> submitting anywhere is zero.
#
# Everything is same-origin: no CDN, no font host, no analytics, no inline <script> and no
# inline <style>. If a view ever needs a `style="..."` attribute in markup it will be blocked
# -- set the property through the element's style object or add a class instead, rather than
# loosening this to 'unsafe-inline'.
/*
  Content-Security-Policy: default-src 'self'; script-src 'self'; style-src 'self'; img-src 'self' data:; font-src 'self'; connect-src 'self'; object-src 'none'; base-uri 'none'; form-action 'none'; frame-ancestors 'none'
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  Referrer-Policy: no-referrer
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
